(b)a company incorporated and resident in Singapore, a partnership registered under any written law in Singapore or a registered business trust that undertakes or intends to undertake, either directly or using an approved special purpose vehicle, the chartering or leasing (including by finance leasing) of a ship, or a container as defined under section 43P(7).
